#### 切换天气案例

嵌入表达式的方式实现
~~~html
 <body>
     <div id="root">
         <h2>今天天气很{{isHot?'炎热':'凉爽'}}</h2>
         <button @click="change">切换天气</button>
     </div>

     <script type="text/javascript">
         const vm = new Vue({
             el: '#root',
             data: {
                 isHot: true
             },
             methods: {
                 change() {
                     this.isHot = !this.isHot
